OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a largely dry day
OL,6,Fand cloudy for the most part. Some
OL,7,Fbright or sunny intervals may break
OL,8,Fthrough the cloud, especially in the
OL,9,Fwest. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening and
OL,12,Fmostly cloudy with some clear
OL,13,Fintervals. Remaining dry overnight
OL,14,Fwith some longer clear spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping, especially in the west.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FIt will be another dry day
OL,18,Fwith a cloudy start, but bright and
OL,19,Fsunny spells breaking through the
OL,20,Fcloud to give longer sunny periods in
OL,21,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
